		{
			"ref_slug": "welcome-2",
			"title": "Welcome",
			"post_content": "<!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"textAlign\":\"center\"}}} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Welcome to your portal</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"textAlign\":\"center\"}},\"fontSize\":\"large\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-large-font-size\">We're glad to have you with us, and we're looking forward to getting started.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:pullquote -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-pullquote\"><blockquote><p>This portal is the home for your project. Everything you need from us, and everything we need from you, lives here. No more hunting through old email threads for that one file or link.</p></blockquote></figure>\n<!-- /wp:pullquote -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"callout-blue\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group callout-blue\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"placeholder\":\"Callout title…\",\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"textAlign\":\"center\"}}} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Prefer to watch? </h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Setup note:</strong> Record a two-minute tour of the portal with Loom, YouTube or Vimeo and embed it here, so clients can watch instead of read. Delete this note before sharing.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What's in your portal</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:table {\"hasFixedLayout\":false} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table><thead><tr><th class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Section</th><th class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">What it's for</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Information</td><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">How we work and what to expect, including this page.</td></tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Your tasks</td><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">The things we need from you to get going: contract, a few questions, your assets, and the kickoff call.</td></tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Useful resources</td><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Ways to reach us, the tools we use, and answers to common questions.</td></tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Add-ons</td><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Optional extras you can add to the project at any point.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<!-- /wp:table -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Where to start</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Read how we work, so you know what to expect. It's the next page along.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Work through your tasks: sign the contract, answer a few questions, and upload your assets.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"#\">Book your kickoff call.</a> Once that's in the calendar, we're off.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Who you'll be working with</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:table -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><thead><tr><th class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Who</th><th class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Role</th><th class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">What they handle</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Jamie Rivera</td><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Point of contact</td><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Your day-to-day questions, updates, and anything you're not sure where to send.</td></tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Sam Okafor</td><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Designer</td><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">The look and feel of everything you see.</td></tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Priya Nair</td><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Developer</td><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Building it and making sure it holds up.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<!-- /wp:table -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>That's the tour. Head to how we work next, or go straight to your tasks. Either way, if you get stuck, Jamie is one message away.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"callout-blue\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group callout-blue\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Setup note:</strong> The team names, roles and sections above are an example. Swap them for your own, or delete any row you do not need. <a href=\"https://clientportalportals.com/client/onboarding-inspiration/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">See the full example portal here</a>. Delete this note before sharing.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n",
			"post_name": "welcome-2",
			"meta": []
		},
		{
			"ref_slug": "how-we-work-2",
			"title": "How we work",
			"post_content": "<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How we work</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This page covers how we run a project: the steps, how we keep in touch, and how feedback works. None of it is complicated. It's here so you always know what's coming and what we need from you.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">The shape of a project</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion -->\n<div role=\"group\" class=\"wp-block-accordion\"><!-- wp:accordion-item -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-item\"><!-- wp:accordion-heading -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle\"><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-title\">1. Kickoff</span><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></button></h3>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-panel -->\n<div role=\"region\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-panel\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We talk through goals, scope, and timeline, and agree what a good result looks like.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>What we need from you:</strong> Your time for the call, and the questionnaire filled in beforehand.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-panel --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-item -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-item\"><!-- wp:accordion-heading -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle\"><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-title\">2. Discovery</span><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></button></h3>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-panel -->\n<div role=\"region\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-panel\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We dig into your brand, your audience, and what is and isn't working now.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>What we need from you:</strong> Access to anything useful: analytics, existing files, examples you like.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-panel --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-item -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-item\"><!-- wp:accordion-heading -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle\"><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-title\">3. Design</span><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></button></h3>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-panel -->\n<div role=\"region\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-panel\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We design in rounds and share work as we go, so nothing is a surprise at the end.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>What we need from you:</strong> Feedback within a few days of each share, to keep momentum.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-panel --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-item -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-item\"><!-- wp:accordion-heading -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle\"><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-title\">4. Build</span><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></button></h3>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-panel -->\n<div role=\"region\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-panel\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We turn the approved design into the real thing and test it properly.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>What we need from you:</strong> Final content, and sign-off on the design before we start.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-panel --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-item -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-item\"><!-- wp:accordion-heading -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle\"><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-title\">5. Launch</span><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></button></h3>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-panel -->\n<div role=\"region\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-panel\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We go live, check everything twice, and hand over what you need to run it.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>What we need from you:</strong> A final review, and a launch date that works for you.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-panel --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-item --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How feedback and revisions work</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We design in rounds. Each project includes two rounds of revisions at the design stage, which is plenty for most projects. If it looks like we'll need more, we'll talk it through rather than spring a surprise on you.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A few things that make feedback easier for everyone:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🗂️ <strong>Gather it in one go rather than in a trickle. </strong><br>One clear message beats ten small ones.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>💡 <strong>Be specific. </strong><br>\"The header feels heavy\" is more useful than \"I'm not sure about it.\"</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>🧠 <strong>Tell us the why where you can. </strong><br>If something needs to change, knowing the reason helps us fix it properly.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>👩‍💻 <strong>Loop in anyone whose opinion matters before you sign off.</strong><br>So we're not redoing approved work later.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"callout-blue\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group callout-blue\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"placeholder\":\"Callout title…\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">We'd rather ask a question than guess. If a brief is unclear, we'll check before we build, not after.</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How we keep in touch</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:table -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><thead><tr><th class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Channel</th><th class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Best for</th><th class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">When to expect a reply</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Slack</td><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Quick questions and day-to-day chat</td><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Same day, within working hours</td></tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Email</td><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Anything related to project admin (invoices, contracts, etc.)</td><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Within 1-2 working days</td></tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">This portal</td><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Files, tasks, and project documents</td><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Always here 24/7</td></tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Calls</td><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Bigger conversations and the kickoff</td><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Booked in advance</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<!-- /wp:table -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We work Monday to Friday, roughly 9 to 5, UK time. We don't reply at weekends, which keeps us fresh for your project during the week.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What we ask of you</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To keep things moving:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Reply to feedback requests within a few days.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Get us assets and content by the dates we agree.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Tell us early if something changes on your side. Timelines shift, and that's fine. We just need to know.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"callout-yellow\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group callout-yellow\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"placeholder\":\"Callout title…\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">If you need anything...</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"placeholder\":\"Callout content…\"} -->\n<p>If anything is ever unclear, or you're not happy with something, tell us early. Most things are easy to sort when they're small. Jamie is your point of contact for anything at all.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"callout-blue\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group callout-blue\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Setup note:</strong> This is how a design studio might describe its process. Rewrite each section to match how you actually work, and delete anything that does not apply. <a href=\"https://clientportalportals.com/client/onboarding-inspiration/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">See the full example portal here</a>. Delete this note before sharing.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n",
			"post_name": "how-we-work-2",
			"meta": []
		},
		{
			"ref_slug": "about-your-business",
			"title": "About your business",
			"post_content": "<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">About your business</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"callout-blue\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group callout-blue\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Embed your questionnaire form</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Setup note:</strong> Use your preferred form tool (Gravity Forms, Typeform, Google Forms, etc.) to build a form from the questions below, then paste the embed code or shortcode here.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A few questions about your business so we start with a clear picture. This is general background that helps on any project, so it's worth filling in once, properly.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Your business</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>In a sentence or two, what does your business do?</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>How did it start, and what problem were you setting out to solve?</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>What are your main products or services?</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Where you are now</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>What's going well, and what's holding you back?</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Who are your main competitors?</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>What makes you different from them?</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Where you're heading</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>What does success look like over the next year or two?</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Are there new products, markets, or directions on the horizon?</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>What's the single most important goal for this project?</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"callout-yellow\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group callout-yellow\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"placeholder\":\"Callout title…\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">⚡️ Quick tip:</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"placeholder\":\"Callout content…\"} -->\n<p>Instead of embedding a form, consider using a shared Google Doc. It stays open, so clients can revisit it, leave comments, and add detail as the project takes shape, rather than answering once and losing access. The questionnaire becomes something you both keep using, not a dead end after submit.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"callout-blue\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group callout-blue\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Setup note:</strong> These example questions come from a real onboarding questionnaire. Keep the ones that fit, add your own, then either embed your form above or leave the list as it is. <a href=\"https://clientportalportals.com/client/onboarding-inspiration/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">See the full example portal here</a>. Delete this note before sharing.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n",
			"post_name": "about-your-business",
			"meta": []
		},
		{
			"ref_slug": "help-and-faq-2",
			"title": "Help and FAQ",
			"post_content": "<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Help and FAQ</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The questions clients ask us most often, answered. If what you need is not here, ask Jamie and we will add it.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion -->\n<div role=\"group\" class=\"wp-block-accordion\"><!-- wp:accordion-item -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-item\"><!-- wp:accordion-heading -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle\"><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-title\">How do I find my way around this portal?</span><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></button></h3>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-panel -->\n<div role=\"region\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-panel\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Everything is grouped into the sections you can see on the main page. <strong>Getting Started</strong> is background reading, <strong>Your Tasks</strong> is the things we need from you, and <strong>Useful Resources</strong> is where to look when you have a question.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Click any card to open it. Tasks you have finished can be ticked off, so you can see at a glance what is left.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-panel --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-item -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-item\"><!-- wp:accordion-heading -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle\"><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-title\">Who do I contact, and how quickly will you hear back?</span><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></button></h3>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-panel -->\n<div role=\"region\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-panel\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Jamie is your point of contact for anything at all, including the things you are not sure who to ask.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Slack for quick questions, same day within working hours. Email for anything to do with contracts or invoices, one to two working days. We work Monday to Friday, roughly 9 to 5 UK time.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-panel --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-item -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-item\"><!-- wp:accordion-heading -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle\"><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-title\">How many rounds of revisions do I get?</span><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></button></h3>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-panel -->\n<div role=\"region\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-panel\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Two rounds at the design stage, which covers most projects comfortably.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If it looks like we will need more, we will say so at the time and talk it through with you first. No surprise invoices.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-panel --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-item -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-item\"><!-- wp:accordion-heading -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle\"><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-title\">What if my deadline moves, or I go quiet for a bit?</span><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></button></h3>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-panel -->\n<div role=\"region\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-panel\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It happens, and it is genuinely fine. Just tell us as early as you can so we can move things around rather than sit waiting.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If a project stalls for more than a few weeks we may need to reschedule it around other work, so an early heads-up protects your slot.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-panel --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-item -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-item\"><!-- wp:accordion-heading -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle\"><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-title\">Can I add a colleague to this portal?</span><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></button></h3>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-panel -->\n<div role=\"region\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-panel\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Yes. Send Jamie their name and email and we will set them up with their own access.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Worth doing early for anyone whose sign-off you will need. It saves you forwarding things on, and means feedback comes to us directly.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-panel --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-item -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-item\"><!-- wp:accordion-heading -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle\"><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-title\">Do I need to keep the files you send?</span><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></button></h3>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-panel -->\n<div role=\"region\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-panel\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Keep your own copies of anything final, yes. This portal stays available after launch, but treat it as a working space rather than long-term storage.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Everything in the Files sections can be downloaded at any time.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-panel --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-item -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-item\"><!-- wp:accordion-heading -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle\"><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-title\">What happens once the project is finished?</span><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></button></h3>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-panel -->\n<div role=\"region\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-panel\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We hand over the finished work along with anything you need to run it yourself, and walk you through it on a final call.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The portal stays up afterwards, so you can come back for files or notes. If you would like us to keep looking after things, have a look at the add-ons.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-panel --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-item --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"callout-yellow\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group callout-yellow\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">⚡️ Quick tip:</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Keep this page open in a tab during the first week or two. Most of the \"sorry, quick question\" emails we used to get are answered somewhere on it.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"callout-blue\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group callout-blue\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Setup note:</strong> Replace these with the questions your clients actually ask — the ones filling your inbox are the right ones. Six or seven is plenty, and each answer works best at two or three sentences. <a href=\"https://clientportalportals.com/client/onboarding-inspiration/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">See the full example portal here</a>. Delete this note before sharing.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n",
			"post_name": "help-and-faq-2",
			"meta": []
		}
